---
import AboutHeroImage from "../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg";
import Layout from "../layouts/BlogPost.astro";
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Read more about VarunVF and this blog"
	pubDate={new Date("August 08 2021")}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		I'm a CS student obsessed with learning about how things work under the
		hood.
	</p>
	<p>
		In my projects, I like to mess around with game engines and games, ray
		tracers, and language design - anywhere I can control the memory layout
		and the render pipeline.
	</p>
	<p>
		I'm fascinated not only by applications, but also the underlying systems
		that make them possible.
	</p>
	<p>Let's build great systems together.</p>
</Layout>
